# {{.AppName}}

An SNS-driven serverless processor built with Lift.

## Architecture

This template provides:

- **SNS Topic**: for publishing events
- **Processor Lambda**: subscribed to the topic
{{ if .EnableData }}- **DynamoDB Table**: a simple persistence layer (DynamORM-ready){{ end }}

{{ if .EnableData }}
```
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌────────────────┐
│ SNS Publish  │────▶│  SNS Topic   │────▶│ Processor Lambda│
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └───────┬────────┘
                                                   │
                                                   ▼
                                            ┌──────────────┐
                                            │  DynamoDB     │
                                            │   Table       │
                                            └──────────────┘
```
{{ else }}
```
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌────────────────┐
│ SNS Publish  │────▶│  SNS Topic   │────▶│ Processor Lambda│
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └────────────────┘
```
{{ end }}

## Quick Start

```bash
# Build the project
lift build

# Deploy to dev stage
lift up --stage dev
```

## Publishing a Test Message

This template uses deterministic naming. For `--stage dev`, the topic name is:

`{{.AppName}}-topic-dev`

Publish a test message:

```bash
AWS_REGION=${AWS_REGION:-us-east-1}
AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=$(aws sts get-caller-identity --query Account --output text)
TOPIC_ARN="arn:aws:sns:${AWS_REGION}:${AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}:{{.AppName}}-topic-dev"

aws sns publish --topic-arn "$TOPIC_ARN" --message '{"hello":"world"}'
```

## Development

### Prerequisites

- Go 1.25+
- AWS CDK CLI (`npm install -g aws-cdk`)
- Lift CLI (`go install github.com/pay-theory/lift/cmd/lift@latest`)
- AWS credentials configured

### Project Structure

```
{{.AppName}}/
├── lift.yaml                 # Project configuration
├── go.mod                    # Go module
├── cmd/
│   └── processor/main.go     # SNS processor Lambda entrypoint
├── cdk/                      # CDK infrastructure
│   ├── cdk.json
│   ├── go.mod
│   └── main.go
└── .github/workflows/        # CI/CD
